                            5
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَثَّلَ بِكَذَا</span></b> 
                         [<i>He affected to be like, or imitated, such a thing;</i>] <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَبَّهَ بِهِ</span>. (TA, art.
